, connected by thin lines to avoid obstructing the pattern. \n\nLower 1/3 (three-segment bottom info-bar): Left area shows 3 circular color palettes with Chinese text labels and HEX codes. Middle area displays a separate black and white jacquard mapping, strictly in 35:75 aspect ratio matching the product above. Right area renders a luxury gift box packaging (open state) and a matching premium shopping bag with a brand logo. \n\nColor palette strictly uses Ochre, Cinnabar Red, and Turquoise Green. All text in Chinese. technical layout, Chinese text labels.\n\n---\n\n**[Color Specs]**\n*   **赭石色 (Ochre)**: `#8B4513` (沉稳大地色基底，提供复古与温暖的视觉支撑)\n*   **朱砂红 (Cinnabar Red)**: `#C9372C` (东方经典点缀色，提亮整体画面，寓意吉祥喜庆)\n*   **松石绿 (Turquoise Green)**: `#25857D` (高贵冷色调穿插，与朱砂红形成经典的敦煌对比色律动)"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 40, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 41, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [40, 61], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 398], "pos": [3694.79296875, 890.7067260742188], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "", "2,0", 0.6, 1142275719, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 72, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 73, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "